  "description": "Monitor-control extension for Periphery (ADR-0058). Provides MonitorDevice (one-shot open) and MonitorDeviceProxy (reconnect-resilient) over two independent planes: DDC/CI VCP control (brightness, contrast, input source, power — dxva2 on Windows, /dev/i2c DDC on Linux) and display-mode control (resolution, orientation, refresh — ChangeDisplaySettingsEx on Windows; Linux deferred).",
